{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 44, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e4b-it", "content": "Hark gentle traveler a Japan itinerary I shall weave\nA journey most grand a tapestry to believe.\n\n**Day One: Arrival in Tokyo a City of Light**\n\nFrom distant shores thou shalt arrive at Narita's gate\nWhere bustling crowds and neon signs do wait.\nTo Shinjuku's heights thy spirit then shall soar\nA panoramic view forevermore.\nA ramen feast a culinary delight\nTo end thy day in Tokyo's vibrant night.\n\n**Day Two: Temples Gardens and Imperial Grace**\n\nTo Asakusa's temples we shall make our way\nWhere ancient wisdom doth forever stay.\nSenso-ji's splendor a sight to behold\nStories of old in its walls unfold.\nThen to the Imperial Palace serene and vast\nA tranquil respite built to forever last.\nGinza's elegance a shopping spree\nFor silks and treasures for thee and me.\n\n**Day Three: Hakone's Beauty a Mountain's Embrace**\n\nHakone's mountains a vista so fair\nA cruise on Lake Ashi beyond compare.\nMount Fuji's peak a majestic crown\nA breathtaking wonder renown.\nArt museums beckon a cultural quest\nTo find thy muse and be truly blessed.\nOnsen's warmth a soothing balm\nTo ease thy cares and keep thee calm.\n\n**Day Four: Kyoto's Charm a Golden Pavilion**\n\nBy bullet train to Kyoto we shall fly\nA city of geishas beneath the sky.\nKinkaku-ji's gold a dazzling gleam\nA mirrored vision a waking dream.\nFushimi Inari's gates a crimson maze\nThrough torii tunnels in a sunlit haze.\nGion district's allure a hidden grace\nWhere geishas dance with elegant pace.\n\n**Day Five: Nara's Deer and Todai-ji's Might**\n\nTo Nara we journey deer roam free\nA sacred haven for all to see.\nTodai-ji's grandeur a temple so grand\nHousing Buddha a sight so planned.\nKasuga Taisha's lanterns softly glow\nA mystical ambiance a gentle flow.\nReturn to Kyoto with memories bright\nOf ancient wonders bathed in soft light.\n\n**Day Six: Osaka's Delights a Culinary Tour**\